ICA Toolkit iOS Plugin :
Plugin for iOS device with NFC interface

Supported iOS Operating System version : iOS 13 or Above
Supported iOS Device : iphone 7 or Later

Frameworks required : CoreNFC.framework

Following are the settings required to be kept in info.plist of the integrated application

	Privacy - NFC Scan Usage Description. App Requires NFC to read the card details

	com.apple.developer.nfc.readersession.formats  
	TAG
	NDEF

	ISO7816 application identifiers for NFC Tag Reader Session
	A000000243001300000001FF
	A0000002430013000000010109
	A00000024300130000000101
	A00000024300130000000103
	A0000002430013000000010101

Please refer to the image attached along with the plugin framework for the above settings.
